<title>NORWAY: Kvaerner wins deals worth 500 mln crowns.</title>
<headline>Kvaerner wins deals worth 500 mln crowns.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Kvaerner ASA said on Wednesday that Kvaerner Energy's subsidiaries in Britain, Sweden and Finland had won contracts worth a total of more than 500 million crowns in the past few weeks.</p>
</text>
